      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the tenth day of the tenth month of the ninth year of our exile, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kgs 25.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 52.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “write down today's date, because this is the day that the king of Babylonia is beginning the siege of Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell my rebellious people this parable that I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have for them:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is saying: “The city of murderers is doomed! It is like a corroded pot that is never cleaned. Piece after piece of meat is taken out, and not one is left. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was murder in the city, but the blood was not spilt on the ground where the dust could hide it; it was spilt on a bare rock. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have left the blood there, where it cannot be hidden, where it demands angry revenge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is saying: “The city of murderers is doomed! I myself will pile up the firewood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring more wood! Fan the flames! Cook the meat! Boil away the broth!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Boil away the broth!",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Burn up the bones! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now set the empty bronze pot on the coals and let it get red-hot. Then the pot will be ritually pure again after the corrosion is burnt off, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "although all that corrosion will not disappear in the flames.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 12 in Hebrew begins with two words, the meaning of which is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem, your immoral actions have defiled you. Although I tried to purify you, you remained defiled. You will not be pure again until you have felt the full force of my anger. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken. The time has come for me to act. I will not ignore your sins or show pity or be merciful. You will be punished for what you have done.” The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “with one blow I am going to take away the person you love most. You are not to complain or cry or shed any tears. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't let your sobbing be heard. Do not go bareheaded or barefoot as a sign of mourning. Don't cover your face or eat the food that mourners eat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Early in the day I was talking with the people. That evening my wife died, and the next day I did as I had been told. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people asked me, “Why are you acting like this?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I said to them, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me and told me ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to give you Israelites this message: you are proud of the strength of the Temple. You like to look at it and to visit it, but the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is going to profane it. And the younger members of your families who are left in Jerusalem will be killed in war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will do what I have done. You will not cover your faces or eat the food that mourners eat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will not go bareheaded or barefoot or mourn or cry. You will waste away because of your sins, and you will groan to one another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I will be a sign to you; you will do everything I have done. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says that when this happens, you will know that he is the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Now, mortal man, I will take away from them the strong Temple that was their pride and joy, which they liked to look at and to visit. And I will take away their sons and daughters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
